{"id": "De11ogfNVaO", "title": "Video by toaidanh_", "description": "Have you ever gone to a restaurant… just to hear people talking?\n\nHe had already cooked at home. But he came anyway, just to sit and watch others eat.\n\nSometimes, the loneliest part of a meal is having no one to say, “Go on. Before it gets cold.”\n\nIf someone is still waiting to share a meal with you today, I hope you’ll give them a little more of your time. 🤍\n\n🎬 WATCHING OTHERS EAT — A show by ToaiDanh\n\n#Loneliness #HumanConnection #AnimatedShortFilm", "channel": "toaidanh_", "uploader_id": "46613229241", "uploader": "Danhtoai", "timestamp": 1792768026, "like_count": 858, "comment_count": 54, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1151370174117088a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 75.95, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN_l_Z5NKimxmgTpOODkcHaFvAeXP8MPqtC1phHuNhYdZukJXlvEjoqxG8T6fzAd_jb6Z3zNrAyDL3KQO1JmUXUw59faKwYcYO08fg.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Ado3MQizv9Q7sPEKqQDicwm7-hQVUPlI3C9kIQfU2L4mq8dBefZ8nVwOCF16hpXwrUiOAF81V6qLVx4Uv2ZMONXV&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=wFCjGW2RLoMQ7kNvwHX1pnT&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Q1S6b6eQs_BOPx5LKaZxuw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQT4FIV2o1GaZlTzglrfrk5xaemECB57HfuuYLS9j3fUhQ&oe=6AF4316B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 75.95, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1151370174117088a - audio o